The '''2015–16 season''' was the 122nd season of competitive football by [[Celtic F.C.|Celtic]]. They competed in the [[2015–16 Scottish Premiership|Scottish Premiership]], [[2015–16 Scottish League Cup|League Cup]] and the [[2015–16 Scottish Cup|Scottish Cup]]. They also competed in the [[2015–16 UEFA Europa League|Europa League]], having been eliminated in the play-off round of the [[2015–16 UEFA Champions League|Champions League]].

